// The stag's body plan (see BEASTS.md): a deer on long thin legs ending in small hooves, a long neck
// carried high, a narrow head, big ears set sideways, a scut of a tail, and antlers - a long beam
// swept back with tines off it. Stylised: the antlers and ears a little big, so it reads from afar.
// Lengths in metres at size 1.
